# P5: the reception's objects (the demo's fixture world), the clock at a fixed time. ANDAR, a
# few steps back from the desk towards the door, so the back wall (clock, ON AIR, calendar,
# vault, plant) and the turntable on the left wall are in frame.
wait 100
inject objects {"Clock":{"unix_s":1000000000,"hour":14,"minute":5,"band":3}}
key w
expect mode ANDAR
down s
wait 600
up s
wait 400
shot ${OUT}/shot-obj-reception.png
dump ${OUT}/dump-obj-reception.json
quit
